#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:2
msgid "Terraform Blueprints"
msgstr "Blueprints de Terraform"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:4
msgid ""
"Terraform Blueprints are one way that Terraform can be integrated and "
"leveraged with |morpheus|, with the other being the |morpheus| Terraform "
"provider which is not discussed in this section. |morpheus| and Terraform"
" are complimentary technologies which together can increase efficiency "
"and simplify automation across cloud environments. For more on this "
"relationship, see our `whitepaper <https://www2.morpheusdata.com"
"/Morpheus-and-Terraform>`_ on how |morpheus| and Terraform are better "
"together."
msgstr ""
"Terraform Blueprints are one way that Terraform puede ser integrated and "
"leveraged with |morpheus|, with the other being the |morpheus| Terraform "
"provider which is not discussed in this section. |morpheus| and Terraform"
" are complimentary technologies which together can increase efficiency "
"and simplify automation across cloud environments. For more on this "
"relationship, see our `whitepaper <https://www2.morpheusdata.com"
"/Morpheus-and-Terraform>`_ on how |morpheus| and Terraform are better "
"together."

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:6
msgid ""
"Currently, |morpheus| supports provisioning Apps based on Terraform "
"Blueprints to VMware, Amazon, Azure, and Oracle Clouds with additional "
"Cloud support coming in future releases. On first attempt to provision a "
"Terraform App, |morpheus| will automatically install Terraform. It is "
"possible in some operating system configurations for this automated "
"installation process to fail, requiring you to install Terraform "
"manually. If needed, manual installation instructions and guidance are "
"provided `here "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/integration_guides/Automation/terraform.html"
"#terraform-installation>`_."
msgstr ""
"Currently, |morpheus| supports provisioning Apps based en Terraform "
"Blueprints a VMware, Amazon, Azure, y Oracle Nubes con additional Nube "
"support coming en future releases. On primer/primera attempt a provision "
"un/una Terraform App, |morpheus| será/n automatically install Terraform. "
"It es possible en algunos/algunas operating system configurations para "
"este/esta automated installation process a fail, requiring you a install "
"Terraform manually. Si needed, manual installation instructions y "
"guidance son provided `here "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/integration_guides/Automation/terraform.html"
"#terraform-installation>`_."

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:8
msgid ""
"To create a new Terraform Blueprint, navigate to |LibBluApp|. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD`."
msgstr ""
"To create a new Terraform Blueprint, navigate to |LibBluApp|. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD`."

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:10
msgid ""
"On the Name tab of the New Blueprint modal, enter a name for your new "
"Blueprint. In the Type dropdown menu, select Terraform. :guilabel:`NEXT`"
msgstr ""
"On el/la Name tab de el/la New Blueprint modal, enter un/una name para "
"your nuevo/nueva Blueprint. In el/la Type dropdown menu, select "
"Terraform. :guilabel:`NEXT`"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:12
#, fuzzy
msgid ".. image:: /images/provisioning/blueprints/new_blueprint.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/provisioning/blueprints/new_blueprint.png"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:15
msgid "In the Blueprint Summary section, complete the following fields as needed:"
msgstr "In the Blueprint Summary section, complete the following fields as needed:"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:17
msgid ""
"**NAME:** Enter a name for this Blueprint as it will appear in the "
"|morpheus| Blueprints list"
msgstr ""
"**NAME:** Enter un/una name para este/esta Blueprint como it será/n "
"appear en el/la |morpheus| Blueprints list"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:18
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** An optional description field for your Blueprint"
msgstr "**DESCRIPTION:** An optional description field for your Blueprint"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:19
msgid ""
"**CATEGORY:** An optional category tag for your Blueprint, such as web, "
"utility, or app"
msgstr ""
"**CATEGORY:** An optional category tag for your Blueprint, como web, "
"utility, or app"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:20
msgid ""
"**IMAGE:** An optional image icon to more easily identify your Blueprint "
"from a list. If no image is uploaded, a default image will be used"
msgstr ""
"**IMAGE:** Un/Una opcional image icon a más easily identify your "
"Blueprint desde un/una list. Si ningún image es uploaded, un/una "
"predeterminado/predeterminada image será/n be used"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:22
msgid ""
"The Terraform Configuration section is where the Terraform template file "
"(.tf) is added or linked to the Blueprint. Using a Config Type of "
"\"Terraform (.tf)\" or \"Terraform JSON (.tf.json)\", you can write or "
"paste your configuration directly into the new Blueprint. Alternatively, "
"you can pull in config files from an integrated Git repository using the "
"\"Git Repository\" Config type."
msgstr ""
"El/La Terraform Configuration section es donde el/la Terraform template "
"file (.tf) es agregado/agregada o linked a el/la Blueprint. Using un/una "
"Config Type de \"Terraform (.tf)\" o \"Terraform JSON (.tf.json)\", you "
"puede/n write o paste your configuration directly en el/la nuevo/nueva "
"Blueprint. Alternatively, you puede/n pull en config files desde un/una "
"integrated Git repository using el/la \"Git Repository\" Config type."

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:24
msgid ""
"In the Terraform Configuration section, complete the following fields as "
"needed when entering your configuration directly into the new Blueprint:"
msgstr ""
"In el/la Terraform Configuration section, complete el/la following fields"
" como needed cuando entering your configuration directly en el/la "
"nuevo/nueva Blueprint:"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:26
msgid ""
"**CONFIG TYPE:** \"Terraform (.tf)\" or \"Terraform JSON (.tf.json)\" to "
"create or paste configuration directly into the new Blueprint"
msgstr ""
"**CONFIG TYPE:** \"Terraform (.tf)\" or \"Terraform JSON (.tf.json)\" to "
"create or paste configuration directly into the new Blueprint"

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:27
