#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/terraform.rst:44
msgid ""
"Your new Terraform Blueprint is now saved and should be visible in the "
"list of Blueprints. Blueprints are deployed in the |ProApp| section of "
"|morpheus|. See the Apps section of |morpheus| docs for more information "
"on that process."
msgstr ""
"Your nuevo/nueva Terraform Blueprint es now saved y debería/n be visible "
"en el/la list de Blueprints. Blueprints son deployed en el/la |ProApp| "
"section de |morpheus|. See el/la Apps section de |morpheus| docs para más"
" information en ese/esa process."

